 medal in " [:a {:href "/results/35519"} "1928"] ", " [:a {:href "/results/35542"} "1932"] ", and " [:a {:href "/results/35547"} "1936"] ", and continued that streak by defeating the homeside British team in the final, 4-0. India would win again in " [:a {:href "/results/35613"} "1952"] " and " [:a {:href "/results/35641"} "1956"] ". The Netherlands and Pakistan played for the bronze medal, and the match ended in a draw, with the Dutch team winning the re-play, 4-1, and the bronze."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/35579"} "Hockey, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "31 July – 13 August 1948"] "\n" [:td {} "187"] "\n" [:td {} "13"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n187 (187/0)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n13 (13/0)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/35579"} "Hockey, Men"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} "India"] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/IND"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/IND.png"}] "IND"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} "Great Britain"] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "G